WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.700 --> 00:00:07.262
Alien Among Us is a bluffing game for four to ten people, and the whole thing starts with a simple question.

2
00:00:07.962 --> 00:00:14.712
Tap your card to find out whether you're a human or an alien. Aliens can see who the other aliens are.

3
00:00:14.862 --> 00:00:24.332
Everyone then answers a short question. Humans all get the same one. Aliens get a similar but different one, so their answers will be a little bit off.

4
00:00:25.033 --> 00:00:32.208
All the answers are shown with names, and then you discuss, in the chat or out loud. Who answered a different question?

5
00:00:32.358 --> 00:00:39.866
Everyone votes for a suspect, and whoever gets the most votes, with at least two, is ejected and their role is revealed.

6
00:00:40.566 --> 00:00:47.145
Humans win by ejecting every alien. Aliens win by surviving until they match the humans.

7
00:00:47.295 --> 00:00:55.955
Keep your answers short and vague if you're an alien. And if you're human, ask, why did you say that? Aliens are terrible at explaining.
